{"id":494,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック教育と実践的な英語学習","feature_description":"神戸海星女子学院はカトリックの精神を基盤に、祈りと学びを日常の中に置いています。中学では英語・数学・国語の基礎を固めながら発展的な学習を進め、中学3年から高校の内容へ接続します。英語では聞く力・話す力を含む学習の充実を図り、授業と家庭学習を重ねて理解を深めます。社会奉仕活動や中高のクラブ活動も学校生活に組み込まれています。","clubs":[{"id":9789,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9790,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9791,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9792,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9793,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9794,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9795,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9796,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9812,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14282,"name":"弦楽アンサンブル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14283,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14284,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kobekaisei.ed.jp/jr-high/life/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":